## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical on-device NLP for latency and privacy, a realistic multilang routing workflow, and federated updates with privacy constraints.

## Key Concepts

- On-device inference with quantization
- Multilingual modeling and adapters
- Federated learning with secure aggregation
- Drift detection and rollback

## Code Example

